[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13983.189, "timestamp": "03:53:03", "text": "关闭他的音频？我简直不敢相信他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13985.51, "timestamp": "03:53:05", "text": "那玩意儿到底是怎么回事？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13988.87, "timestamp": "03:53:08", "text": "在空中攻击马车。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13993.75, "timestamp": "03:53:13", "text": "一条典型的龙绝不会这样做。教授。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13995.349, "timestamp": "03:53:15", "text": "先生，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13998.95, "timestamp": "03:53:18", "text": "我们在哪里？我不知道。瞧，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14000.71, "timestamp": "03:53:20", "text": "发现的那把钥匙显然是一个端口"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14003.91, "timestamp": "03:53:23", "text": "钥匙。端口密钥？一件被施了魔法的物品"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14005.59, "timestamp": "03:53:25", "text": "将任何接触过它的人带到特定地点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14009.349, "timestamp": "03:53:29", "text": "地方。嗯？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14010.71, "timestamp": "03:53:30", "text": "等等，我应该把这个音频关掉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14012.63, "timestamp": "03:53:32", "text": "可视化。先生，我感觉好多了。如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14015.59, "timestamp": "03:53:35", "text": "你想四处看看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14020.15, "timestamp": "03:53:40", "text": "我会的，但要待在附近。这是这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14024.229, "timestamp": "03:53:44", "text": "这是卫生用品。但为什么？他们为什么这样做？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14032.79, "timestamp": "03:53:52", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14039.189, "timestamp": "03:53:59", "text": "图标键。"}]